---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950 py-12 text-slate-400">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Zero-Upload Manifesto -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-lg font-extrabold text-white">
            Aman<span class="text-emerald-400">Dok</span>
          </span>
          <span class="rounded border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400">
            100% LOCAL SANDBOX
          </span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="mt-3 max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400"
          data-i18n-id="AmanDok dirancang untuk melindungi masyarakat Indonesia dari kebocoran data KTP, KK, dan NPWP. Seluruh pemrosesan gambar dan PDF berjalan murni di dalam memori browser Anda menggunakan HTML5 Canvas & WebAssembly tanpa pengiriman ke server."
          data-i18n-en="AmanDok is engineered to protect citizens from ID card and document leaks. All image and PDF processing runs strictly inside your browser memory using HTML5 Canvas & WebAssembly with zero server uploads."
        >
          AmanDok dirancang untuk melindungi masyarakat Indonesia dari kebocoran data KTP, KK, dan NPWP. Seluruh pemrosesan gambar dan PDF berjalan murni di dalam memori browser Anda menggunakan HTML5 Canvas & WebAssembly tanpa pengiriman ke server.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Ekosistem & Tautan -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h3
          class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200"
          data-i18n-id="Fitur Utama"
          data-i18n-en="Core Capabilities"
        >
          Fitur Utama
        </h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-emerald-400">Watermark KTP Anti-Pinjol</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-emerald-400">Sensor & Blur NIK / Tanda Tangan</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-emerald-400">Kompresor Target KB (CPNS/SSCASN)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-emerald-400">Gabung KTP & Berkas ke PDF A4</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Developer Portfolio & Open Source -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h3
          class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200"
          data-i18n-id="Open Source & Pengembang"
          data-i18n-en="Open Source & Developer"
        >
          Open Source & Pengembang
        </h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://ritonga.ai.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-emerald-400"
            >
              Aliando Ritonga (Portfolio) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/andoritonga/amandok"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-emerald-400"
            >
              Kode Sumber (GitHub Public Repo) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://gaji.ritonga.ai.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-emerald-400"
            >
              HitungGaji.id (PPh 21 TER) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-6 text-xs sm:flex-row">
      <p>© {year} AmanDok • Built by <a href="https://ritonga.ai.id" class="font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:text-emerald-400">Aliando Ritonga</a></p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400/90">
        CSP: connect-src 'self' • Zero Telemetry • Zero Cloud Storage
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
